:180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-a8.1","local_name":"bob-cli-a8.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-a8","agent_clan_generation":"20261020173917","bead_id":"bob-cli-a8.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-a8[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Bob Mac Capture Ctrl+Tab panel switch and show-path performance[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Ctrl+Tab (and Ctrl+Shift+Tab) in either Bob Mac Capture panel [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]switches to the other panel. Capture keeps its draft and caret, and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Refs keeps its remembered view. Showing, switching, and typing in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]both panels do less redundant main-thread work and spawn fewer bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]processes, with no change to what bob decides.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]mac_capture_panel_switch_and_perf.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/mac_capture_panel_switch_and_perf.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-a8[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-a8/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ctrl+Tab panel switch with preserved state[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel_switch[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel_switch: add the coordinator switch, Ctrl+Tab routing in both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panels with a deferred hop, the Refs panelSwitch presentation source, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]round-trip state tests, switch signposts, and the keyboard/refs/capture [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture show, keystroke, and refresh optimizations[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture_perf[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel_switch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture_perf: remove no-op republishes, the per-render executable stat, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and repeated view-tree walks; add the fuzzy-matcher fast path and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coalesced show refreshes for targets and templates; add measuring [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]signposts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Refs show, keystroke, ranking, and refresh optimizations[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]refs_perf[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel_switch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs_perf: drop the unread published row rect, cache the filter field, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coalesce library-publish passes, skip unchanged inspector and Today [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]republishes, precompute ranking sort keys, fix the stale prepared-item [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache, and coalesce the panel-open Today refresh.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-a8","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-a8.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-402380de7ab80cc1d12fc3f8dcb5f0b5","started_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:06.659672+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"8681e2aa103780164c301de1e4916b473cc9120d734e1e38a6cd17615370e5ef","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-a8.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"di